{"id": "en_car_blizzard_p2", "total": 70.93, "segments": [{"text": "Part 2. Heavy snow has completely buried Mark's exhaust pipe, threatening carbon monoxide buildup.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.4}, {"text": "Mark immediately cuts the engine to stop toxic carbon monoxide gas from flooding inside.", "start": 5.86, "end": 9.94}, {"text": "He opens his door into the biting wind to inspect the rear bumper area.", "start": 10.68, "end": 13.58}, {"text": "One. He quickly pushes away the heavy packed snow clearing the exhaust pipe.", "start": 14.38, "end": 18.06}, {"text": "A blocked pipe fills the car cabin with invisible gas in a few minutes.", "start": 18.38, "end": 21.2}, {"text": "Two. He steps back inside the shelter and cracks the side window open a little.", "start": 21.92, "end": 25.2}, {"text": "Fresh outside air flows inside, keeping the atmosphere inside the car safe and clear.", "start": 25.68, "end": 29.12}, {"text": "Three. He runs the engine to get heat for about 10 minutes each hour.", "start": 29.6, "end": 33.04}, {"text": "Running the heater constantly wastes precious fuel while Mark waits for morning help.", "start": 33.52, "end": 36.58}, {"text": "He double checks that the bright cloth remains tied firmly outside on his door.", "start": 37.4, "end": 40.3}, {"text": "The bright cloth gives search teams a visible marker in the blinding white storm.", "start": 40.88, "end": 43.74}, {"text": "He keeps the interior dome light turned on so rescue crews spot him easily.", "start": 44.52, "end": 47.66}, {"text": "Leaving the car to walk through deep snow puts any driver in grave danger.", "start": 48.34, "end": 51.3}, {"text": "Staying inside the car provides shelter and keeps him much easier to locate.", "start": 51.8, "end": 54.92}, {"text": "Glowing headlights approach through darkness as snowplow operators finally reach his stranded vehicle.", "start": 56.16, "end": 60.36}, {"text": "Mark safe inside waves at the rescue team as they clear a path.", "start": 60.9, "end": 63.72}, {"text": "Always stay inside your car during a highway blizzard. Follow for a new scenario tomorrow.", "start": 64.2, "end": 67.78}], "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.4], ["2.", 0.4, 0.68], ["Heavy", 1.46, 1.64], ["snow", 1.64, 1.88], ["has", 1.88, 2.08], ["completely", 2.08, 2.46], ["buried", 2.46, 2.9], ["Mark's", 2.9, 3.24], ["exhaust", 3.24, 3.46], ["pipe,", 3.46, 3.72], ["threatening", 4.04, 4.24], ["carbon", 4.24, 4.58], ["monoxide", 4.58, 4.98], ["buildup.", 4.98, 5.4], ["Mark", 5.86, 6.28], ["immediately", 6.28, 6.78], ["cuts", 6.78, 7.1], ["the", 7.1, 7.3], ["engine", 7.3, 7.46], ["to", 7.46, 7.6], ["stop", 7.6, 7.76], ["toxic", 7.76, 8.22], ["carbon", 8.22, 8.48], ["monoxide", 8.48, 8.88], ["gas", 8.88, 9.12], ["from", 9.12, 9.36], ["flooding", 9.36, 9.6], ["inside.", 9.6, 9.94], ["He", 10.68, 10.92], ["opens", 10.92, 11.1], ["his", 11.1, 11.28], ["door", 11.28, 11.4], ["into", 11.4, 11.64], ["the", 11.64, 11.78], ["biting", 11.78, 12.04], ["wind", 12.04, 12.28], ["to", 12.28, 12.46], ["inspect", 12.46, 12.74], ["the", 12.74, 12.94], ["rear", 12.94, 13.06], ["bumper", 13.06, 13.28], ["area.", 13.28, 13.58], ["One.", 14.38, 14.56], ["He", 14.96, 15.16], ["quickly", 15.16, 15.42], ["pushes", 15.42, 15.66], ["away", 15.66, 15.9], ["the", 15.9, 16.02], ["heavy", 16.02, 16.32], ["packed", 16.32, 16.66], ["snow", 16.66, 17.0], ["clearing", 17.0, 17.36], ["the", 17.36, 17.52], ["exhaust", 17.52, 17.78], ["pipe.", 17.78, 18.06], ["A", 18.38, 18.56], ["blocked", 18.56, 18.76], ["pipe", 18.76, 18.98], ["fills", 18.98, 19.28], ["the", 19.28, 19.46], ["car", 19.46, 19.62], ["cabin", 19.62, 19.88], ["with", 19.88, 20.04], ["invisible", 20.04, 20.32], ["gas", 20.32, 20.56], ["in", 20.56, 20.76], ["a", 20.76, 20.82], ["few", 20.82, 20.98], ["minutes.", 20.98, 21.2], ["Two.", 21.92, 22.2], ["He", 22.52, 22.68], ["steps", 22.68, 22.84], ["back", 22.84, 23.1], ["inside", 23.1, 23.38], ["the", 23.38, 23.56], ["shelter", 23.56, 23.7], ["and", 23.7, 23.92], ["crac